// Typing the name of something new (a beat, a character, a function or one of
// their parameters) gets no completion: the names that exist aren't what is
// being written.

character bob
  name: Bob

function helper()
  return 1

beat Machin
  Hello
  -> Ma

beat M
  Text.

public beat Mo
  Text.

character bo
  name: Bo

function he()
  return 2

function twice(value)
  return value * 2

beat Visit(first, second = Machin)
  Visit $first.

